{"id":"magic-crayon","title":"The Magic Crayon","level":4,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"096794bd5cb1c2ae3fd6dc2b5fd55c3d","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["draws","claws","jaws","yawns","bird","toy","blue"],"common":["the","he","my","oh"],"challenge":["magic","dinosaur","word"],"before":"If you had a magic crayon, what would you draw?","after":["What did Logan draw first?","What went wrong when Dash drew a dinosaur?","How did Logan stop the dinosaur?","What would you draw with the magic crayon?"],"retell":[2,5,8,9,12,15],"pages":[{"text":"Logan spots a crayon in the grass.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"02a7cc5bce99dd5a63721a49059d9806","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A sunny back garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed).","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"He draws a bird on the path.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"806caf9745a046ff428187984e39ba14","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan draws a simple bird with the purple crayon on the garden path paving stones.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The bird flaps up off the path! Tweet!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"616cd07f11d8e72af544de60e13d1603","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Magic: the drawn bird peels off the path and flies up.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It is a magic crayon!","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"My turn!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"7f1f3e13a03b432a9fa8199a633f1a61","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia stare at the crayon in awe while the crayon bird circles their heads.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia draws a blue toy car. Beep, beep!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"889aa0865787e783024fc896c516cb69","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A blue crayon-scribble toy car zooms off the path with Dash riding on top, arms up.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash draws a big, big dinosaur.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"00bb5f83b49aac7c560f80ef7caac9ed","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash holds the crayon with both hands (it is nearly as big as him) and draws a huge dinosaur outline across the whole path.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It has sharp claws and big jaws.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"0213220f2271d8f902ad07f759f28c9b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The drawn dinosaur outline glows purple.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"ROAR! It stomps off the path.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b9046a3ec72c15a02c764fa54d24dd97","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A giant purple crayon-scribble dinosaur, goofy rather than scary, rears up off the path and roars.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It stomps on Dad's flowers!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"0026bcd8e07360499c39dd855008a167","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The crayon dinosaur stomps across Dad's flower bed, petals flying.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But the dinosaur will not stop.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"Stop!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"844e97392f1998ba6bb142af9c33fb08","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia holds up her hands and shouts at the crayon dinosaur, which is happily trampling the flowers.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan has a plan. He draws a big soft bed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"e6810da44fe8ae31ef0c5f6119fc0c48","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan draws a huge cosy bed with a pillow on the lawn using the crayon, with a determined face.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then he draws a word on it: NAP.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"12fb50a604d44466b8806b6a58dd4482","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up: big glowing purple crayon letters drawn on the blanket of the crayon bed.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The dinosaur yawns. It curls up and naps.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d3e17f63c43ba794401ed90d78b56f09","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The crayon dinosaur curls up in the crayon bed, snoring gently.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia fix Dad's flowers.","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"Shhh!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"67bea6eb6f7d08ba296f62a9e6f1949e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia draw new flowers in the flower bed; they pop up as bright crayon flowers.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But now Dash has the crayon. Uh oh!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"002d9291947123f4916da5779add10b0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash runs off behind a bush with the crayon, where he is drawing a mountain of ice creams with a cheeky grin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}